With this update you get a new game mode: Sandbox.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42863846/b4534d9817fadab39f0ec7bd9303bbc49d01785a.gif[/img]

Main features:
[list]
[*] add as many ducks as you need (up to 999);
[*] remove all ducks in one click;
[*] trigger random events;
[*] direct control on a selected duck using keyboard.
[/list]

Warning: duck madness may cause the game to crash
